# Mockup Factory Integration (opt-in)

When the current feature has a UI dimension (it includes one or more
user-facing screens), generate or refresh visual mockups via the global
Claude Code skill `/mockup-factory` BEFORE producing screens references
or design plans.

Invocation contract:

- `/mockup-factory --target . --groups <derived-from-feature> --product <derived-from-stack>`
- `--groups` is derived from the feature description (e.g. `auth,onboarding`).
- `--product` is derived from `.specs/stacks/_default.md` product type
  (e.g. `web`, `mobile`).

Skip if `.specs/design/screens/` already contains screens matching the
feature scope.
